<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73709" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοί-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a being made like,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					176b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>likeness, resemblance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lap.</u>
				41
			</span></i> ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοίωσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				454c
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὁμοίωσιν θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
					3.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>establishment of a resemblance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὁ. ἕνεκεν αὐτῆς λαμβάνεσθαι τὰς
					μεταφοράς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.177
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Gramm., <i>comparison,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσεως ἐπιρρήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.T.
					642.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>simile,</i> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				84
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pythag.
			</span></i> name for <i>nine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theol.Ar.
				57
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
